1
00:00:01,159 --> 00:00:05,610
kurts geredt, er traybt mir arayn in komendature,

2
00:00:05,850 --> 00:00:09,270
in blok, in a BEDROOM.

3
00:00:09,647 --> 00:00:14,200
a tish, un es zitst, eyner a doytsh,

4
00:00:14,355 --> 00:00:16,171
zitst er oto do o.

5
00:00:16,667 --> 00:00:20,420
⟨in dem⟩ mundir in dem Natsi zitst er.

6
00:00:20,717 --> 00:00:23,720
zogt er mir... on keyn shum reyd...

7
00:00:23,720 --> 00:00:25,841
zogt er, "her, JUD," makht er,

8
00:00:25,881 --> 00:00:29,739
"vi hot zikh dir ayngegebn bizl aher blaybn lebn?"

9
00:00:31,780 --> 00:00:33,924
zog ikh, "⟨iz vos iz fun⟩ deroyf?"

10
00:00:34,099 --> 00:00:36,523
makht er, "ershtns hostu gefresn,"

11
00:00:37,137 --> 00:00:41,970
zogt er, "umzist undzere shpayz.

12
00:00:42,958 --> 00:00:46,411
a JUD," zogt er, "tor nit lebn un tor nit esn keyn shpayz.

13
00:00:47,481 --> 00:00:51,021
du host gegesn," zogt er, "undzere grins, undzere shpek,

14
00:00:51,021 --> 00:00:52,790
undzere broyt."

15
00:00:55,193 --> 00:01:00,412
trakht ikh, "vu iz do shpek? vu iz do broyt? vu iz d⟨os⟩? BALANDA,

16
00:01:00,412 --> 00:01:03,813
 mit a shtikl broyt fun erza-" do hot men shoyn gegebn erzats,

17
00:01:03,813 --> 00:01:07,728
fun OPILKes, vos me, me zegt holts, faln OPILKes;

18
00:01:07,728 --> 00:01:09,449
mit deroyf, mit klayen,

19
00:01:09,449 --> 00:01:12,343
fun mel klayen, vos me zipt iber,

20
00:01:12,343 --> 00:01:16,123
iz bakt men dos tsunoyf un zey makhn... zey zaynen dokh khimiker groyse...

21
00:01:16,123 --> 00:01:18,806
un me korme- un me kormet mit deroyf,

22
00:01:18,806 --> 00:01:21,461
 hodevet men on di gefangene.

23
00:01:22,075 --> 00:01:24,448
"ver hot dos," zogt er, "dir geratevet

24
00:01:25,298 --> 00:01:28,920
bizl aher? bist dokh durkhgegangen," zogt er, "azelkhe,

25
00:01:28,977 --> 00:01:33,730
, iberkukung." zog ikh,...

26
00:01:34,090 --> 00:01:39,520
do iz shoyn nito keyn reyd im zogn, "ikh bin nit keyn yid." ⟨az ikh⟩ zol zikh oyston...

27
00:01:39,520 --> 00:01:42,471
nor fun dest vegn hob ikh a zog geton, "⟨ikh bin⟩ nit keyn yid."

28
00:01:43,692 --> 00:01:48,293
zogt er, "her, drey mir nit dem moyekh. tu oyset dos o, dayne mayses."

29
00:01:48,720 --> 00:01:50,891
zog ikh, "nu, gut, zol zayn a yid.

30
00:01:51,268 --> 00:01:55,280
nor mir hot geratevet," hob ikh gezogt oyf ANTONYUKn,

31
00:01:55,588 --> 00:01:57,809
oyf dem, der vos hot mir aroysgegebn.

32
00:01:58,693 --> 00:02:01,724
"ot der hot mir geratevet," zog ikh, "in Gorlovke,

33
00:02:01,883 --> 00:02:05,319
un zayn khaver in Gorlovke," zog ikh, "a STEPAN.

34
00:02:05,427 --> 00:02:08,289
zey hobn mir geratevet, bin ikh derfar do."

35
00:02:08,363 --> 00:02:12,330
zogt er, "du vest im derkenen, dem ANTONYUKn?" er zogt tsu mir.

36
00:02:12,801 --> 00:02:15,480
zog ikh, "er iz a komisar. ikh veys nit. er iz,

37
00:02:15,480 --> 00:02:17,632
er gefint zikh," zog ikh, "in Gorlovke."

38
00:02:17,632 --> 00:02:19,257
nor ikh hob ⟨im⟩ shoyn do gezen.

39
00:02:20,682 --> 00:02:26,126
zogt er, "⟨az m'vet⟩ oysshteln," zogt er, "dir a, di gantse gefangene, vestu gefinen," zogt er, "im?"

40
00:02:26,588 --> 00:02:29,619
zog ikh, "neyn. mir," zog ikh, "shik nit oyf deroyf.

41
00:02:30,013 --> 00:02:32,250
mit ale..." zog ikh,

42
00:02:32,250 --> 00:02:35,960
"ikh vel nit geyn zukhn," zog ikh. "er hot dokh mir geratevet, vel ikh,

43
00:02:35,960 --> 00:02:40,604
vet men, genug," zog ikh, "vos m'vet mir teytn. vest dokh mir alts eyns hargenen.

44
00:02:40,965 --> 00:02:43,051
du vest mir hargenen?" tsu im zog ikh.

45
00:02:43,328 --> 00:02:46,494
zogt er, "oyb du vest alts zogn, vel ikh dir nit hargenen."

46
00:02:46,888 --> 00:02:50,630
zog ikh, "kh'hob dokh dir gezogt ver er iz.

47
00:02:52,002 --> 00:02:53,363
kh'hob dir gezogt!"

48
00:02:54,027 --> 00:02:59,780
makht er, "dos iz," zogt er, "nokh nit keyn reyd." er hot a ponem gevust

49
00:02:59,780 --> 00:03:03,538
ver hot dos mir aroysgegebn. ken zayn, er hot gevust, ken zayn, er hot nit gevust,

50
00:03:03,612 --> 00:03:08,010
nor er hot ibergegebn durkh imetsn, oder er aleyn hot ibergegebn.

51
00:03:08,286 --> 00:03:11,790
kurts geredt, er hot a ruf geton dray soldatn

52
00:03:12,707 --> 00:03:16,919
un zey gezogt az zey, me zol makhn, ⟨az⟩ me zol makhn mit mir a sof.

53
00:03:17,635 --> 00:03:20,590
nu, do hot men mir a, gegebn a knak on dr'erd.

54
00:03:20,824 --> 00:03:23,453
m'hot mir ongehoybn poykn... zey zaynen gegangen

55
00:03:23,453 --> 00:03:26,420
in shtivl. bay zey iz geven kurtse shtivl bay di soldatn,

56
00:03:26,815 --> 00:03:29,947
mit azelkhe UNK ⟨KAK, a-⟩ azoy vi a TRAPETSIYA,

57
00:03:30,747 --> 00:03:35,180
mit ayzene untn di podeshve, mit ayzns ongeklapt.

58
00:03:35,180 --> 00:03:36,911
hobn zey mir ongehoybn poykn.

59
00:03:36,911 --> 00:03:38,706
bay mir iz avek glaykh blut

60
00:03:39,100 --> 00:03:41,822
f- fun, fun tsure ergets tseshnitn.

61
00:03:41,822 --> 00:03:46,370
shrayt er, "nit HIER! nit HIER!" "nit do! oyfn gas!

62
00:03:46,828 --> 00:03:49,066
UNK farshmutsikn de- dem brik."

63
00:03:49,647 --> 00:03:51,683
⟨hot men⟩ aroysgeshlept mir oyfn gas.

64
00:03:52,363 --> 00:03:56,322
me hot mir mit koyekh... vos hob ikh shoyn gehat far a koyekh dortn o, bizl deroyf?

65
00:03:56,430 --> 00:04:00,670
un m'hot mir gegebn a shtikl poyk mitn kop on boym.

66
00:04:00,868 --> 00:04:03,258
es iz geshtanen a lipe, a boym,

67
00:04:03,349 --> 00:04:05,283
a grobe boym. ikh gedenk ir.

68
00:04:05,644 --> 00:04:07,750
ot shteyt zi antkegn mayne oygn.

69
00:04:07,872 --> 00:04:13,060
un ikh hob farlorn mayn bavust, farlorn.

70
00:04:13,795 --> 00:04:15,999
az ikh hob oyfgeefnt di oygn...

71
00:04:16,832 --> 00:04:18,817
zey hobn gemeynt az zey hobn mir geharget.

72
00:04:20,055 --> 00:04:22,192
zey hobn... vi, vi ikh farshtey...

73
00:04:22,519 --> 00:04:27,090
zey hobn mir arayngevorfn in OTSEK, in dem

74
00:04:27,090 --> 00:04:30,410
blok, vos s'iz geven arumgetsamt mit azelkhe drot,

75
00:04:31,007 --> 00:04:35,840
mit gedikhte. iz geven in, gufe in lager, in groysn lager,

76
00:04:35,840 --> 00:04:39,310
iz geven oto der arumgetsamt

77
00:04:39,343 --> 00:04:42,492
b- bazunder arumgetsamt a kleyner blok...

78
00:04:43,140 --> 00:04:46,870
aropgefaln.... iz der blok,

79
00:04:47,595 --> 00:04:50,238
in dem blok hob ikh zikh oyfgekhapt oyfn hoyf.

80
00:04:52,911 --> 00:04:56,803
ikh hob nit gekent iberkern zikh; mir iz umedum geven tutvey,

81
00:04:57,957 --> 00:05:02,237
un iber hoypt di kop, hot bay mir gerudert di kop,

82
00:05:02,985 --> 00:05:08,510
gerudert, nor ikh hob zikh ibergedreyt oyf, oyf a zayt.

83
00:05:10,849 --> 00:05:13,037
bay mir iz ongeshvoln der moyl,

84
00:05:13,836 --> 00:05:18,150
di tsure tseklapt. do iz, fil ikh blut mit zamd,

85
00:05:18,763 --> 00:05:22,351
un bay mir, ikh krikh arayn in moyl, bay mir feln tseyner.

86
00:05:22,476 --> 00:05:24,208
dray tseyner oysgeklapt:

87
00:05:24,838 --> 00:05:27,190
tsvey, dray UNK...

88
00:05:28,923 --> 00:05:30,700
ikh bin shoyn a gehargeter.

89
00:05:31,223 --> 00:05:34,470
"alemay bin ikh lebn geblibn," trakht ikh,

90
00:05:34,616 --> 00:05:38,030
"nokh a mol zol men mir hargenen?" hob ikh

91
00:05:38,997 --> 00:05:42,889
a trakht geton az ikh darf gefinen a mitl oyf endikn mit mir.

92
00:05:44,565 --> 00:05:46,871
ikh hob aropgeri- aropgenumen

93
00:05:48,210 --> 00:05:50,111
fun danen mayn shtrikl...

94
00:05:50,303 --> 00:05:52,761
di hoyzn hot untergehaltn a shtrikl...

95
00:05:53,458 --> 00:05:55,375
un ikh hob avekgepoyzet

96
00:05:56,226 --> 00:06:01,780
un aroyfgekrokhn oyf di trep poyzendikerheyt un arayn in blok.

97
00:06:02,267 --> 00:06:05,390
kh'hob gemeynt az dortn faran nares.

98
00:06:05,390 --> 00:06:07,540
dortn avu mir zaynen geven, di

99
00:06:07,540 --> 00:06:10,547
algemeyne gefangene, iz nares drayendike:

100
00:06:10,553 --> 00:06:13,090
eyn nare, a tsveyte, a drite,

101
00:06:13,090 --> 00:06:17,500
⟨A,⟩ un do iz in zaytn st- stolbes ⟨ts- un⟩ tsugeklapt,

102
00:06:17,500 --> 00:06:19,575
shtangen un breter oyf, ongeleygt.

103
00:06:20,391 --> 00:06:22,106
hob ikh tsugepoyzet,

104
00:06:22,416 --> 00:06:24,480
un nito oyf vu tsu hengen zikh.

105
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:26,443
nito oys vos tsu hengen zikh!

106
00:06:28,980 --> 00:06:31,589
 hob ikh ongehoybn aroyspoyzen oyf kerik.

107
00:06:32,035 --> 00:06:38,340
un iz mir gekumen in kop az ikh darf araynkrikhn in lager in dem algemeynem

108
00:06:38,397 --> 00:06:41,985
un dortn aroyfvarfn zikh oyf di drotn

109
00:06:42,413 --> 00:06:44,347
vos firt oyfn gas.

110
00:06:45,315 --> 00:06:49,376
iz oyb dortn iz ELEKTRICHESTVO vet mir nit hargenen, elektrye,

111
00:06:49,568 --> 00:06:53,120
vet mir hargenen der vakh-man vos shteyt oyf di VYSHKes, oyf di,

112
00:06:53,120 --> 00:06:56,008
oyf di hiltsene b- gebaydes, gebaydlekh,

113
00:06:56,520 --> 00:06:58,049
⟨azoy⟩ mit pulemyotn.

114
00:07:01,515 --> 00:07:06,410
ikh gey arum perimeter

115
00:07:06,410 --> 00:07:09,376
fun untn. ikh heyb di drot. ⟨es,⟩

116
00:07:09,376 --> 00:07:14,345
ikh, bay mir geyt blut, nor ikh vil nit filn gornisht nit;

117
00:07:14,345 --> 00:07:16,207
alts eyns geharget vern.

118
00:07:16,213 --> 00:07:20,700
ikh heyb, ikh heyb, un dortn fun tsofn-zayt... fun tsofn-zayt, fardreyt...

119
00:07:20,700 --> 00:07:24,050
fun perimeter hob ikh gefunen a shlafkeyt in drot

120
00:07:24,050 --> 00:07:27,150
un ikh hob dos di shlafkeyt m- mit beyde hent,

121
00:07:27,300 --> 00:07:29,285
azoy ligndik oyfn rukn,

122
00:07:29,460 --> 00:07:31,259
un ikh hob ongehoybn mit di fis

123
00:07:31,401 --> 00:07:34,500
pamelekh opshtupn zikh, opshtupn zikh,

124
00:07:34,894 --> 00:07:39,470
un ikh hob aroysgepoyzet. ikh bin aroysgepoyzet oyf dem zayt.

125
00:07:40,412 --> 00:07:45,310
un ikh hob ongehoybn poyzen un

126
00:07:45,627 --> 00:07:48,620
ikh bin dergangen bizl finftn blok,

127
00:07:48,620 --> 00:07:52,761
nor ikh ze, ot do hot zikh, klapt zikh a tir. me geyt aroys, me ken mir derzen;

128
00:07:52,761 --> 00:07:54,040
ikh muz zikh shteln.

129
00:07:54,655 --> 00:07:58,935
un ikh hob zikh pamelekh avekgeshtelt un ikh hob ot azoy vi a shikerer,

130
00:07:59,211 --> 00:08:01,044
azoy vi a shikerer geyt

131
00:08:01,202 --> 00:08:03,862
bin ikh avekgegangen. ot iz der ployt:

132
00:08:04,425 --> 00:08:06,258
nem un varf zikh oyf im aroyf!

133
00:08:06,855 --> 00:08:09,410
VSЁ. UNK.

134
00:08:10,855 --> 00:08:12,891
ikh hob zikh nit ongenumen dos ton.

135
00:08:13,183 --> 00:08:16,360
ikh trakht, "bizl fartog iz nokh tsayt.

136
00:08:16,778 --> 00:08:19,700
a sho tsayt lebn iz oykh darf men."

137
00:08:20,355 --> 00:08:24,730
ikh hob nit gekent keyn mol gleybn az ikh vel gefinen a mitl

138
00:08:24,730 --> 00:08:26,711
oyf aroysgeyn a lebediker,

139
00:08:26,852 --> 00:08:28,989
az mir vet imetser helfn.

140
00:08:29,535 --> 00:08:33,320
ikh hob far- farshtanen az do ken got oykh nit helfn.

141
00:08:33,332 --> 00:08:36,245
m'hot shoyn mir aroysgegebn; me hot shoyn mir geharget.

142
00:08:36,825 --> 00:08:39,395
m'vet mer nit, vi vet nor vern fartog

143
00:08:39,395 --> 00:08:43,335
un m'vet oysshteln, kumen di, di SVORe,

144
00:08:43,335 --> 00:08:45,276
m'vet oysshteln di gefangene

145
00:08:45,276 --> 00:08:49,880
oyf ibertseyln, vet men derzen az do o iz nito der gehargeter,

146
00:08:50,342 --> 00:08:52,069
vet vern aza min

147
00:08:52,069 --> 00:08:55,430
shtikl tararam, es vet vern aza min oyfzukh,

148
00:08:55,430 --> 00:08:57,199
es vet vern aza min gelof,

149
00:08:57,199 --> 00:08:59,800
azoy vi zey hobn farlorn dem front,

150
00:08:59,800 --> 00:09:03,240
azoy hobn, zey hobn far- z- zey hobn farshpilt...

151
00:09:03,240 --> 00:09:05,152
mir hot zikh gedukht

152
00:09:05,597 --> 00:09:11,720
az zey voltn beser aropnemen finf divizyes, groyse,

153
00:09:11,720 --> 00:09:14,280
a man fuftsik toyznt, fun front,

154
00:09:14,280 --> 00:09:15,868
eyder lozn lebn a yidn.

155
00:09:16,245 --> 00:09:17,670
azoy hot zikh mir gedakht.

156
00:09:17,670 --> 00:09:19,701
nit umzist hobn di poyerim gezogt

157
00:09:19,701 --> 00:09:23,799
az di milkhome hobn di NEMTSes gem- ongehoybn tsulib deroyf...

158
00:09:24,379 --> 00:09:29,050
nit tsulib deroyf, tsulib di, geyn farkhapn lender,

159
00:09:29,050 --> 00:09:33,050
nor tsulib hargenen di yidn. "ZA ZHIDOV MY,"

160
00:09:33,050 --> 00:09:36,660
zogn zey, "VOEVALI PROTIV NEMTSEV."

161
00:09:36,664 --> 00:09:41,650
farshteyst? aza min agitatsye iz geven un aza min retsikhe ⟨k-⟩ iz geven tsum yidn.

162
00:09:42,098 --> 00:09:45,065
me, keyner veys bay hayntikn tog nit far vos iz dos.

163
00:09:45,065 --> 00:09:47,272
tsum bayshpil, nu, Hitler ⟨iz⟩ a meshugener,

164
00:09:47,650 --> 00:09:52,630
ober di NEMTSes, di NEMTSes, ale biz eyne⟨r⟩ hobn dokh geshrien "⟨H⟩EIL!"

165
00:09:52,630 --> 00:09:55,693
zey hobn dokh ale geyogt zikh hargenen a yidn.

166
00:09:55,885 --> 00:09:59,237
a kleyn kind hot bay zey nit getort blaybn lebn.

167
00:10:00,053 --> 00:10:02,443
yeder NEMETS biz eyner!

168
00:10:02,854 --> 00:10:05,940
tomer iz geven efsher a guter NEMETS, hot er im arayngezetst

169
00:10:05,940 --> 00:10:10,700
ergets dortn in di, lagern. zey zaynen dernokh dem aroysgegangen lebedike.

170
00:10:10,700 --> 00:10:13,120
zey hobn, zey, m'hot zey gemakht ZA,

171
00:10:13,120 --> 00:10:15,403
ZA BLOKOVYKH NACHAL'NIKOV

172
00:10:15,797 --> 00:10:19,453
un azoy vayter. zey flegn shlogn di, di yidn.

173
00:10:21,383 --> 00:10:25,650
kurts geredt, ikh bin gegangen fun blok tsu blok, azoy gegangen,

174
00:10:25,650 --> 00:10:27,215
vayle do iz geven,

175
00:10:27,357 --> 00:10:29,798
oto do o tsvishn finftn blok

176
00:10:30,124 --> 00:10:34,280
un zekstn iz geven der SANUZEL, der optret,

177
00:10:34,280 --> 00:10:37,326
avu me geyt mit di baderfenish, fun,

178
00:10:37,326 --> 00:10:39,399
gemakht gevorn fun breter.

179
00:10:39,844 --> 00:10:45,069
iz bay der nakht hobn di gefangene gemegt geyn. ver tshepet zey? s'iz dokh,

180
00:10:45,413 --> 00:10:48,005
di VYSHKes, dokh ergets nit antloyfn.

181
00:10:48,248 --> 00:10:52,830
kurts geredt, iz di vakh-manes, az ikh fleg durkhgeyn afile

182
00:10:52,830 --> 00:10:55,350
farbay MEZHDU BLOKAMI,

183
00:10:55,350 --> 00:11:00,662
hobn zey mir oykhet nit ge- nit, nit fa- zey hobn gezen, nor nit farshtanen, zey meynen az ikh gey,

184
00:11:00,803 --> 00:11:03,142
 fun shlof gey ikh ahin tsum optret.

185
00:11:03,620 --> 00:11:09,330
 hob ikh gegangen, gegangen, gegangen farbay blok,

186
00:11:09,330 --> 00:11:11,242
un ot iz der ployt,

187
00:11:11,434 --> 00:11:14,181
gel⟨ozn zikh⟩ vayter durkh, vilt zikh epes...

188
00:11:14,181 --> 00:11:16,820
ikh hob shoyn glat nit gevust vos ikh vil.

189
00:11:16,820 --> 00:11:18,178
ikh tsi di tsayt.

190
00:11:18,387 --> 00:11:22,262
un ikh bin dergangen tsu dem letstn... kh'hob zikh fardreyt;

191
00:11:22,470 --> 00:11:24,033
se geyt a kvadrat,

192
00:11:24,192 --> 00:11:27,344
hob ikh zikh shoyn fardreyt. tsum bayshpil, ot ⟨iz⟩ gegangen azoy,

193
00:11:27,344 --> 00:11:30,150
hob ikh zikh shoyn fardreyt aher tsu di blokn un ikh gey,

194
00:11:30,150 --> 00:11:33,315
un tsvishn di blokn iz di, der ployt zet zikh durkh,

195
00:11:33,422 --> 00:11:35,491
un ikh bin dergangen bizl aher.

196
00:11:36,004 --> 00:11:38,850
ot do iz shoyn gornisht nito.

197
00:11:38,873 --> 00:11:45,246
do iz nor der ployt, un do ⟨i-⟩ a VYSHKe a groyse shteyt, a VYSHKe vu der soldat mit alts.

198
00:11:45,319 --> 00:11:47,878
trakht, "ikh vel geyn itster hargenen zikh.

199
00:11:48,373 --> 00:11:51,300
⟨s'iz⟩ shoyn nito vos ⟨tsum⟩ kenen zikh UNK."

200
00:11:52,238 --> 00:11:54,442
un tsu dem blok bin ikh dergangen.

201
00:11:54,567 --> 00:11:56,046
