202
00:11:56,693 --> 00:12:00,560
trakht ikh, "ikh vel opruen." instinktiv, instinktiv.

203
00:12:00,560 --> 00:12:01,766
ikh hob gornisht nit...

204
00:12:02,734 --> 00:12:06,035
instinktiv hot mir getsit: "lig zikh."

205
00:12:06,210 --> 00:12:08,347
un ikh lig zikh avek oyfn ganek.

206
00:12:09,147 --> 00:12:10,676
kh'hob kimat vi

207
00:12:12,083 --> 00:12:13,393
a fal geton.

208
00:12:14,614 --> 00:12:16,177
vifl hob ikh gelegn...

209
00:12:18,445 --> 00:12:22,800
un ikh nem, ikh trakht, "oy..." ikh heyb zikh oyfet,

210
00:12:23,760 --> 00:12:25,914
un ikh ze ongeshribn: "lazaret."

211
00:12:26,882 --> 00:12:29,820
ikh hob gevust vos ⟨s'iz⟩ dortn frier a lazaret, nor ⟨fa- geven fa-⟩

212
00:12:29,820 --> 00:12:32,023
itster hob ikh dokh VOOBSHCHE fargesn in alts.

213
00:12:32,890 --> 00:12:35,601
hob ikh zikh dermont az dortn iz SARKISYAN.

214
00:12:44,078 --> 00:12:46,502
ikh hob zikh dermont az dortn iz SARKISYAN.

215
00:12:47,132 --> 00:12:50,480
nem ikh, "ikh vel zikh geyn mit im,"

216
00:12:51,469 --> 00:12:53,015
trakht ikh, "zegenen."

217
00:12:57,358 --> 00:12:59,411
"ikh vel zikh geyn mit im zegenen."

218
00:13:02,843 --> 00:13:06,530
trakht ikh, "neyn. ikh vel aroysrufn efsher a khshad oyf im.

219
00:13:07,011 --> 00:13:12,690
halemay darf ikh geyn SARKISYANen araynsh- -shlepn in deroyf?

220
00:13:15,145 --> 00:13:18,176
un ikh gib a fal oyf der tir un ikh fal arayn,

221
00:13:18,300 --> 00:13:19,948
kimat vi arayngefaln,

222
00:13:20,089 --> 00:13:24,690
un ikh⟨, un,⟩ azh a lof geton ahin o un ikh hob gefaln oyf dr'erd.

223
00:13:25,793 --> 00:13:27,390
geyt eyner aroys

224
00:13:29,320 --> 00:13:30,799
un kert mir umet

225
00:13:32,391 --> 00:13:37,450
un derzen mayn tsure di gantse... es hot gebrent a lempele in der heykh; s'iz geven der koridor...

226
00:13:38,095 --> 00:13:40,806
un shlept mir aroyf in der heykh,

227
00:13:40,828 --> 00:13:45,320
oyf di, TO EST', shtelt mir aveket, un shlept mir arayn in BEDROOM.

228
00:13:45,486 --> 00:13:47,049
geshtanen a tish.

229
00:13:47,460 --> 00:13:51,431
dos ⟨hot zikh OKAZYVet⟩ der dizhurner,

230
00:13:51,431 --> 00:13:55,620
der dokter velkher bay der nakht, ⟨veyst⟩...

231
00:13:56,657 --> 00:13:58,558
zogt er, "KTO TEBYA TAK?

232
00:14:00,032 --> 00:14:04,430
TY," zogt er, "POLUMЁRTVYY." "du bist dokh a toyter."

233
00:14:07,238 --> 00:14:10,140
zog ikh, "gib a ruf SARKISYANen."

234
00:14:11,659 --> 00:14:14,251
"gib a ruf," zog ikh, "SARKISYANen aher."

235
00:14:15,777 --> 00:14:17,580
er hot gebrakht SARKISYANen.

236
00:14:17,869 --> 00:14:21,600
SARKISYAN hot mir SRA- lekhatkhile nit derkont,

237
00:14:22,594 --> 00:14:26,130
⟨nor az⟩ ikh hob ongehoybn reydn... ikh hob geredt nit mit dem GOLOS:

238
00:14:26,130 --> 00:14:27,729
tseyner a p- dray iz nito,

239
00:14:27,729 --> 00:14:30,380
ongeshvolene lipn, di tsure tsehakt.

240
00:14:30,643 --> 00:14:31,936
