244
00:14:42,996 --> 00:14:45,190
"kh'hob nit uspeyet. antshuldik.

245
00:14:45,679 --> 00:14:47,377
ikh hob nit," zogt er,

246
00:14:49,932 --> 00:14:53,350
"ikh hob farshpetikt. antshuldik mir."

247
00:14:55,281 --> 00:14:56,439
