252
00:15:11,683 --> 00:15:17,410
zogt er, "m'vet dokh morgn khapn zikh; m'vet dokh undz alemen tsehargenen!

253
00:15:17,708 --> 00:15:21,873
oyb m'vet pakn im do," zogt er, "vet min di k- nit nor undz,

254
00:15:21,873 --> 00:15:24,182
