255
00:15:25,048 --> 00:15:26,257
er zogt azoy.

256
00:15:27,512 --> 00:15:29,159
nem ikh, heyb zikh oyfet,

257
00:15:29,773 --> 00:15:31,454
un ikh hob ongehoybn avekgeyn.

258
00:15:32,288 --> 00:15:34,104
kh'hob gevolt aroysgeyn shoyn

259
00:15:34,414 --> 00:15:36,630
dem letsn gang maynem makhn.

260
00:15:37,688 --> 00:15:39,420
ikh bin dergangen tsum tir,

261
00:15:39,814 --> 00:15:41,512
ersht er khapt mir onet

262
00:15:42,227 --> 00:15:43,874
un shlept mir kerik,

263
00:15:44,691 --> 00:15:47,110
mir arumgenumen unter ⟨der⟩ hant.

264
00:15:47,442 --> 00:15:48,600
"kum," zogt er.

265
00:15:48,960 --> 00:15:51,890
"der dokter BOLDIN hot gezogt, m'vet a trakht ton,

266
00:15:52,352 --> 00:15:54,134
mir'n a trakh ton vos tsu ton."

267
00:15:55,997 --> 00:15:58,870
er hot im avekgeshikt un hot gebrakht

268
00:15:59,372 --> 00:16:01,104
Sashen ODINTSOVn.

269
00:16:02,106 --> 00:16:06,900
oto di gedenk ikh azoy vi itster di po- penemer zeyere.

270
00:16:06,900 --> 00:16:11,880
yeder zakh, a mentsh velkher hot dir geton guts oyf, oyf aza zakh,

271
00:16:11,880 --> 00:16:13,896
iz fargedenkt men oyf eybik.

272
00:16:15,049 --> 00:16:17,270
gekumen a darer poyer.

273
00:16:18,103 --> 00:16:24,476
keyn sheyne zaynen mir shoyn dortn keyner nit geven, vayle mir zaynen ale geven gele, farfintsterte.

274
00:16:25,393 --> 00:16:32,199
der hot gekent, der hot gekent a bisl shener zayn antkegn mir az, i- a- antkegn an- nit antkegn mir, antkegn,

275
00:16:32,199 --> 00:16:36,030
 MELKONYANen, tsum bayshpil, vayle er hot nit keyn,

276
00:16:36,030 --> 00:16:38,637
 DOBAVOCHNe hilf,

277
00:16:38,637 --> 00:16:40,300
nor er hot gearbet.

278
00:16:40,300 --> 00:16:43,343
er hot gearbet in der komande, er iz geven a brigadir

279
00:16:43,348 --> 00:16:46,346
fun der komande vos firt aroys di toyte.

280
00:16:46,960 --> 00:16:50,080
me klaybt tsunoyf di toyte, far tog, az,

281
00:16:50,080 --> 00:16:53,860
far deroyf eyder me shtelt zikh oyf, oyfn,

282
00:16:53,860 --> 00:16:56,353
oyfn iberrekhenen di...

283
00:16:57,270 --> 00:16:58,513
kurts geredt,

284
00:17:00,342 --> 00:17:01,922
gebrakht dem Sashen,

285
00:17:04,223 --> 00:17:05,719
un mit dem Sashen

286
00:17:05,809 --> 00:17:09,549
hobn zey opgeton aza zakh... dos hob ikh zikh dervust dernokh dem...

287
00:17:10,617 --> 00:17:12,805
zey hobn genumen, SARKISYAN

288
00:17:13,420 --> 00:17:15,287
mit Sashen ODINTSOVn,

289
00:17:15,512 --> 00:17:17,835
me hot genumen di DVUKOLKe

290
00:17:18,042 --> 00:17:21,850
oyf velkher me v-... s'iz oyf tsvey reder geven a, a vogn,

291
00:17:22,666 --> 00:17:25,545
un me hot aroyfgeleygt oyf im

292
00:17:25,553 --> 00:17:30,165
geshtorbene... flegt ale tog shtarbn fun DIZENTERIYA, fun dos, fun yents

293
00:17:30,165 --> 00:17:33,640
in lazaret... un UNK

294
00:17:33,640 --> 00:17:36,246
avekgefirt a- a- ahin eynem.

295
00:17:36,353 --> 00:17:38,692
avekgefirt. s'iz dokh bay der nakht nokh,

296
00:17:39,120 --> 00:17:45,015
un di vakh-manes oyf di VYSHKes zaynen geveynt gevorn az zey geyen, nokh az s'iz fintster,

297
00:17:45,015 --> 00:17:48,125
geyen zey zukhn, unterklaybn toyte.

298
00:17:48,452 --> 00:17:50,938
un fun andere erter iz zet men nit,

299
00:17:50,938 --> 00:17:53,930
di V-, ver es geyt un ver es fort, di V- di VYSHKes;

300
00:17:53,930 --> 00:17:55,365
farshtelt fun di blokn.

301
00:17:55,489 --> 00:18:00,242
kurts geredt, yener ort avu ikh bin aroysgegangen, d⟨er SMERTNer,⟩ iz geven farshtelt.

302
00:18:00,872 --> 00:18:03,228
zey hobn untergerukt ahin a mes,

303
00:18:03,673 --> 00:18:06,650
a toytn, oyf mayn ort.

304
00:18:07,285 --> 00:18:11,710
mayn nomer, ⟨v- d-⟩ yenem nomer vos s'iz bay mir geven,

305
00:18:12,567 --> 00:18:16,192
vos s'iz geven farshribn mayn nomer oyfn nomen SARKISYAN,

306
00:18:16,192 --> 00:18:17,657
hot men oyf im ongeton.

307
00:18:17,967 --> 00:18:20,441
zaynem hobn zey dervayl gegebn mir.

308
00:18:22,557 --> 00:18:25,656
oyf, nor bay alemen iz geven opgerisene hertser.

309
00:18:26,286 --> 00:18:29,260
ikh bin geven oys mentsh⟨. zey dertseyln mir...⟩

310
00:18:30,100 --> 00:18:34,906
er hot mir arumgekukt, er hot mir getapt, gekvetsht umedum, tsi tsebrokhene beyner bay mir.

311
00:18:34,906 --> 00:18:38,450
umedum vu er kvetsht iz mir tutvey. umedum.

312
00:18:38,503 --> 00:18:42,360
dem moyl, m'hot mir mit aza min geler,

313
00:18:42,360 --> 00:18:48,183
 mit, gele, azelkhe vaser hot men mir, bagosn, un hot zikh gePENet un gedreyt,

314
00:18:48,544 --> 00:18:50,816
un er hot mir mit epes geshmirt.

315
00:18:52,408 --> 00:18:55,844
un es iz dergangen morgn...

316
00:18:59,057 --> 00:19:01,245
vart, s'iz nokh nit dergangen morgn.

317
00:19:01,403 --> 00:19:07,680
s'iz morgn ye, s'iz morgn ye. shoyn, b- bay der nakht, dos iz shoyn nokh, nokh tsvelf a zeyger alts.

318
00:19:07,680 --> 00:19:11,910
s'iz ergets geven a zeyger dray tsi tsvey a zeyger fa- b- bay der nakht.

319
00:19:12,777 --> 00:19:19,900
VOT. iz shoyn a, a zeyger fir hobn zey gedarft aroysfirn, tsi finf, di gehargete,

320
00:19:20,522 --> 00:19:25,545
iz hot er oyfgevekt di gantse komande zayne... s'zaynen geven zeks tsi akht man...

321
00:19:25,568 --> 00:19:30,711
un zey hobn avekgefirt, tsunoyfgeleygt di toyte, ongeleygt dem ve- dem vogn,

322
00:19:30,711 --> 00:19:33,307
un m'hot avekgefirt. un Sashe ODINTSOV

323
00:19:33,533 --> 00:19:38,340
hot kloymersht, er hot SLUCHAYNe, er hot, dos derzen,

324
00:19:38,983 --> 00:19:42,630
tsufelik, on, on, on tam.

325
00:19:43,995 --> 00:19:49,844
zogt, zogn tsveyen az zey veln loyfn im nemen, aroys⟨leyg⟩n un avekleygn aher. zogt er, "neyn.

326
00:19:50,357 --> 00:19:52,325
me darf a ruf ton dem dizhurnem"...

327
00:19:52,804 --> 00:19:56,630
dem di- dizhurnem MLADSHn ofitser...

328
00:19:57,107 --> 00:20:00,256
es dizhuret, bay der nakht a MLADSHer ofitser....

329
00:20:00,567 --> 00:20:02,417
"a ruf ton, zol er a kuk ton."

330
00:20:04,228 --> 00:20:07,676
er hot avekgegangen tsum tir durkhn vakh-man.

331
00:20:07,676 --> 00:20:09,740
der MLADSHer ofitser iz gekumen.

332
00:20:09,797 --> 00:20:12,727
zey hobn dokh shoyn ale gevust az m'hot a yidn geharget.

333
00:20:13,864 --> 00:20:16,861
hot er a kuk geton ahin, aher. zogt er...

334
00:20:17,256 --> 00:20:19,460
bay Sashen hot zikh opgerisn di yorn,

335
00:20:19,804 --> 00:20:22,700
vorem er hot zeyer shtark batrakht.

336
00:20:22,892 --> 00:20:25,451
dernokh dem hot er geheysn aropnemen dem nomer.

337
00:20:25,980 --> 00:20:27,762
hot er aropgenumen den nomer.

338
00:20:28,107 --> 00:20:30,860
zogt er, "DAS iz JUDEN.

339
00:20:31,178 --> 00:20:35,860
STIMMT. RAUS! nor," zogt er, "⟨d-⟩ di shikh zol men aropnemen."

340
00:20:37,725 --> 00:20:40,824
UNK genumen yenem, dem toytn,

341
00:20:41,927 --> 00:20:46,580
un me hot far mir, VMESTO MENYA...

342
00:20:47,277 --> 00:20:50,510
ikh bin, ikh bin geblibn dortn o,

343
00:20:50,510 --> 00:20:53,565
a lebediker dervayl, a halb-lebediker

344
00:20:53,655 --> 00:20:57,288
bin ikh, un m'hot dos shoyn avekgefirt un arayngevorfn im in grub, im

345
00:20:57,288 --> 00:21:01,050
dem ershtn un dernokh dem di o oyf im, ahin, aher,

346
00:21:01,050 --> 00:21:05,400
un m'hot mit a bisl zamd, ibergeshotn. zey hobn,

347
00:21:06,143 --> 00:21:13,545
oyf morgedikn tog zaynen zey, bay, b- bay alemen iz geven, ale zaynen geven zeyer, ⟨d-⟩ ibergeshrokn,

348
00:21:14,344 --> 00:21:18,945
i der dokter BOLDIN, i SARKISYAN, i Sashe ODINTSOV.

349
00:21:19,052 --> 00:21:22,370
zey hobn gemeynt, veyst dokh, NEMTSes,

350
00:21:22,370 --> 00:21:24,631
NEMTSes gleybn keynem nit.

351
00:21:25,144 --> 00:21:28,125
⟨s'heyst,⟩ imetsn vet arayngeyn in kop, "A MOZHET...

352
00:21:28,637 --> 00:21:32,290
f- far vos iz er do untergepoyzet a gehargeter?

353
00:21:33,312 --> 00:21:36,259
vi hot er gekent unterpoyzen?" ken imetsn arayngeyn in kop

354
00:21:36,298 --> 00:21:38,030
geyn a kuk ton,

355
00:21:39,066 --> 00:21:40,460
ken men dos aroysshlepn.

356
00:21:41,850 --> 00:21:44,291
nor es iz durkhgegangen etlekhe teg.

357
00:21:44,938 --> 00:21:49,370
me hot in der tsayt hot men ⟨U-⟩

358
00:21:50,220 --> 00:21:52,981
UNICHTOZHIT', me hot,

359
00:21:53,325 --> 00:21:55,563
dem lager, dem geto,

360
00:21:56,042 --> 00:21:59,950
me hot, oyf ibermorgn...

361
00:22:01,881 --> 00:22:03,917
es brent di shtot.

362
00:22:05,408 --> 00:22:10,633
ikh ze aleyn. mir f⟨ir⟩t unter SARKISYAN, tsum fentster,

363
00:22:11,179 --> 00:22:13,434
zogt, "gib a kuk: es brent di shtot."

364
00:22:15,094 --> 00:22:18,250
un a treskeray dergeyt oykhet aher in lager,

365
00:22:18,250 --> 00:22:23,019
vayle s'iz nit vayt iberiks fun lager; m'hot dokh undz getribn grobn di griber.

366
00:22:23,633 --> 00:22:27,806
vos iz geven? vi iz dos, vi hot men tseharget di yidn in,

367
00:22:27,806 --> 00:22:29,764
in, CHENSTOKHOV?

368
00:22:29,764 --> 00:22:32,970
 ken, meg ikh dertseyln? tsi me darf nit?

369
00:22:33,268 --> 00:22:36,100
di yidn in CHENSTOKHOV... m'hot dertseylt, di komandes

370
00:22:36,100 --> 00:22:40,468
v- di arbeter-komandes vos zaynen gegangen in shtot hobn dernokh dem gebrakht di yedie

371
00:22:40,896 --> 00:22:42,240
az far tog...

372
00:22:42,718 --> 00:22:45,496
dos iz geven in SENTYABR' khoydesh...

373
00:22:46,296 --> 00:22:52,370
far tog ⟨iz⟩ geyen komandes, yidishe komandes hot men getribn arbetn, oyf arbet.

374
00:22:52,624 --> 00:22:56,630
der natshalnik, der, gubernator

375
00:22:56,630 --> 00:22:59,452
hot zikh gerekhnt a gants voyler NEMETS.

376
00:23:00,319 --> 00:23:06,151
er flegt nit lozn di yidn, me zol, shisn glat in der velt arayn. azoy dertseylt men.

377
00:23:06,394 --> 00:23:09,410
er iz geven a ELEGANTNer NEMETS.

378
00:23:12,604 --> 00:23:14,032
kurts geredt,

379
00:23:18,004 --> 00:23:21,950
me hot di komande, di komandes

380
00:23:23,539 --> 00:23:24,933
hot men geheysn,

381
00:23:26,140 --> 00:23:32,038
⟨hot⟩ men geheysn geyn oyf andere arbet, nit oyf shtendike arbet, velkhe me fleg zey traybn

382
00:23:32,432 --> 00:23:34,687
oyfn stantsye vu der ban,

383
00:23:35,858 --> 00:23:37,776
oyf di felder,

384
00:23:37,900 --> 00:23:40,450
dos aropnemen, yents aropnemen,

385
00:23:40,450 --> 00:23:44,040
oyf tsuklaybn, eynike UNK...

386
00:23:44,040 --> 00:23:46,620
kh'vey- m'hot zey nit getribn oyf di arbetn.

387
00:23:46,620 --> 00:23:49,439
m'hot zey getribn ahin tsu di griber.

388
00:23:49,439 --> 00:23:51,545
m'hot zey gezogt, "oyf an ander arbet."

389
00:23:51,585 --> 00:23:53,081
m'hot zey opgenart.

390
00:23:53,475 --> 00:23:57,190
m'hot zey gebrakht tsu tribn, un me hot zey

391
00:23:57,897 --> 00:23:59,798
getsvungen oyston zikh,

392
00:24:00,411 --> 00:24:05,028
un me hot zey alemen tseharget. me hot tsugetribn nit glaykh ale komandes:

393
00:24:05,136 --> 00:24:07,681
ot me brengt a partye fun a fuftsik man,

394
00:24:07,681 --> 00:24:09,588
vayter a partye fun a fuftsik man,

395
00:24:09,588 --> 00:24:11,655
un azoy hot men tseharget

396
00:24:11,655 --> 00:24:16,340
di arbeter, di feike, di feike, di shtarke yidn hot men tseharget.

397
00:24:16,577 --> 00:24:22,510
iz geblibn in di lagern di kinder, di vayber mit di alte layt.

398
00:24:23,260 --> 00:24:27,995
ot do hot men shoyn ongehoybn untertraybn ahin gaz-mashines,

399
00:24:28,491 --> 00:24:31,134
un me hot zey gevorfn in di mashines.

400
00:24:31,495 --> 00:24:34,020
di vos kenen geyn flegt men ahin arayntraybn,

