00:24:34,127 --> 00:24:37,074
un me hot gefirt azoy POTOKOM hot men gefirt

402
00:24:37,198 --> 00:24:39,284
ahin tsu di griber,

403
00:24:39,358 --> 00:24:42,659
un me hot farvorfn di griber mit CHENSTOKHOVer yidn.

404
00:24:43,932 --> 00:24:47,830
azoy iz nit gevorn di yidn in CHENSTOKHOV.

405
00:24:48,572 --> 00:24:51,430
un azoy, du host gehat dos, di

406
00:24:51,492 --> 00:24:54,300
tsveyte falshe nomen fun dem...?

407
00:24:54,158 --> 00:25:00,126
ye, DA., iz durkhgegangen nokh a bisl tsayt. me hot nit getort haltn dem nomen fun dem toytn,

408
00:25:00,469 --> 00:25:03,568
vorem der toyter iz gekumen fun a blok.

409
00:25:04,047 --> 00:25:07,292
in a blok iz faran a, an elterer fun a blok,

410
00:25:07,292 --> 00:25:09,097
