00:25:26,440 --> 00:25:32,910
UNK farshteyst? iz me k- keyn sakh tor er nit lign, in lazaret.

416
00:25:33,156 --> 00:25:36,216
hot men do gikh gedarft makhn mir

417
00:25:36,216 --> 00:25:39,750
naye, a nayem nomer; dos iz mayn pasport,

418
00:25:39,822 --> 00:25:41,132
mayn dokument.

419
00:25:41,543 --> 00:25:42,921
kurts geredt,

420
00:25:43,163 --> 00:25:47,910
es iz durkhgegangen a por vokhn tsayt. ikh hob shoyn ⟨on- ge⟩kumen tsu zikh.

421
00:25:48,141 --> 00:25:53,200
m'hot shoyn fun mir aropgeshlept... m'hot gemeynt az ikh vel sht- er hot gemeynt, mir hot BOLDIN zikh PRIZNAet, mir gezogt,

422
00:25:53,200 --> 00:25:56,430
az "ikh hob gemeynt az du vest shtarbn," zogt er. "ikh hob dir kam aroysgeshlept."

423
00:25:56,916 --> 00:26:00,979
"un du flegst," zogt er, "bredyen. mir hobn moyre gehat, zolst nit reydn az du bist a yid."

424
00:26:00,979 --> 00:26:03,469
un, s'iz geven tsores.

425
00:26:03,469 --> 00:26:05,786
 "du bist gelegn," zogt er, "oto do o.

426
00:26:06,062 --> 00:26:07,760
mit undz ⟨bistu⟩ geshlofn."

427
00:26:08,020 --> 00:26:10,438
kurts geredt, m'hot mir gegebn...

428
00:26:10,438 --> 00:26:13,869
es iz geven fun finftn blok iz geven dortn a polkovnik,

429
00:26:14,213 --> 00:26:17,694
iz er geven an ARMYANIN. er iz geven... tsi a GRUZIN;

430
00:26:17,694 --> 00:26:20,720
ikh gedenk shoyn nit. nor er iz geven der blokover.

431
00:26:20,777 --> 00:26:23,052
er iz geven a reyner

432
00:26:23,052 --> 00:26:24,990
mentsh a sovetisher.

433
00:26:25,587 --> 00:26:31,318
er hot dos mir oysgemakht a, fun a, ongekumen a naye partye fun gefangene,

434
00:26:31,510 --> 00:26:37,860
hot er arayngerukt oto dem a nayem nomer shoyn: zibetsn toyznt fir hundert I zibetsik nayn.

435
00:26:38,361 --> 00:26:41,274
SEMNADTSAT' TYSYACH CHETYRESTA SEM'DESYAT DEVYAT'.

436
00:26:41,618 --> 00:26:47,467
dos iz, vel ikh fargedenken bizl SAM⟨en⟩ toyt, funem ershtn⟨, dokh,⟩ in mitn nakht, ven ⟨vest⟩

437
00:26:47,524 --> 00:26:51,840
⟨mir,...⟩ SEMNADTSAT' TYSYACH CHETYRESTA SEM'DESYAT DEVYAT'

438
00:26:51,945 --> 00:26:53,537
bin ikh shoyn gevorn.

439
00:26:53,537 --> 00:26:55,770
es iz durkhgegangen a bisl tsayt.

440
00:26:55,843 --> 00:26:57,946
zogt mir MELKONYAN,

441
00:26:58,425 --> 00:27:03,170
"es darf zayn a partye, velkhe me shikt aveket di NATSMENes

442
00:27:03,170 --> 00:27:05,982
shikt men avek," makht er, "in GERMANIYA.

443
00:27:05,982 --> 00:27:07,768
