452
00:27:37,137 --> 00:27:40,890
a kleyn leb⟨elekh⟩, hot mir gegebn a shinel oyf onton,

453
00:27:40,890 --> 00:27:43,816
a mantl aza. kh'hob UNK dos nit gehat, a VOENNem; bay mir iz

454
00:27:43,816 --> 00:27:46,699
alts geblibn, dortn o in,

455
00:27:46,840 --> 00:27:48,876
in mayn, in traktor.

456
00:27:48,949 --> 00:27:55,340
kurts geredt, m'hot mir gegebn a KOTELOK, a lefl, sh-, shikh. dortn ⟨iz dokh, a sakh zaynen⟩ geshtorbn dokh, iz geven shoy-

457
00:27:55,340 --> 00:27:56,638
shoyn vos tsu onton.

458
00:27:57,235 --> 00:28:02,320
un ⟨hot mir,⟩ in a fartog aroysgefirt

459
00:28:02,320 --> 00:28:04,738
un gezogt azoy: "gey farbay di blokn

