00:28:05,757 --> 00:28:07,618
un kum ahin o," zogt er.

461
00:28:07,618 --> 00:28:11,099
"on-o shteyen," zogt er, "shoyn mentshn fun zekstn blok.

462
00:28:11,173 --> 00:28:12,770
